66b85"}," as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Full-Round Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Full-Round_Action"},". Roll once per round. If you fail, you make no progress through the water. If you fail by 5 or more, you go underwater and must hold your breath with an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Endurance"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Endurance","referenceId":"reference:98c8abf84e23ff3f"}," check until you can reach the surface by succeeding on a Swim check.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The DC for the Swim check depends on the situation:\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["SITUATION\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["DC\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Calm Water\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["10\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Rough Water\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["15\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Stormy Water\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["20\n"]}]}]}]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
